  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate Policy in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate Policy in Lao PDR aims to strengthen policy and institutional capacity of Lao PDR&#x2019;s line ministries to better address climate change impacts, enhance climate resilience, and increase climate finance through carbon credits. The program will create a coordinated multi-sectoral framework for sustainable participation in international carbon markets to increase flows of carbon finance into Laos, facilitate carbon sequestration and reduce greenhouse gas emissions. The program will also assist Lao PDR&apos;s preparation of their NDC 3.0 for the energy sector, ensuring policy alignment that will create a bigger impact and contribute to achieving Lao PDR&#x2019;s climate goals.</narrative>
  </description>
