   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Governance</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Climate Policy in Lao PDR program has significantly enhanced the accountability and capacity of Lao government ministries in developing and implementing climate change policies. 
&#x200d;
DFAT&#x2019;s support has enabled the Government of Laos to develop a comprehensive governance framework for Laos to participate in international carbon markets under Article 6 of the Paris Agreement. This will channel carbon finance towards accelerating the country&#x2019;s climate commitments and sustainable development goals. 
&#x200d;
Three key government agencies have been strengthened, the Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry, Ministry of Industry and Commerce, and the Bank of the Lao PDR.</narrative>
    </description>
